                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 2.</seg></opener>
                <head>Count Bismarck to Count
                        Bernstorff.</head>
                <p>Please announce once more to Mr. Washburne that Captain Rochous, who was sent by
                    General Alvensleben to Toul with a flag of truce, has been repulsed by
                    successive shots, and that a trumpeter accompanying, yesterday, another flag of
                    truce to Verdun has been killed. We protest solemnly against these repeated
                    violations of international law, and declare that we shall be henceforth in the
                    impossibility of sending flags of truce to the French army.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
